SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍理：2025.4月\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           海运到港：2025.7月\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式：水洗 Washed\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           风味：红布林、蔓越莓、葡萄柚、血橙、熟普\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Red plum, Cranberry, Grapefruit, Blood orang\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           e, Ripe Pu'er tea\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           这个批次的酸甜口，入口最直接的感受是红色的核果和莓果的酸甜，李子蔓越莓之类的，然后再到柑橘，像葡萄柚和橙子（血橙）的酸甜，中低温特别像很多熟普的茶感感受～\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n           特征关键词：红色核果莓果+红色柑橘\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           关于瀑布庄园\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           The Waterfall瀑布庄园，是位于哥伦比亚安蒂奥基亚吉拉多塔镇(Girardota)山顶的一个有富含盐矿的峡谷，周边大片的原始森林，离麦德林只有30分钟车程。Mateo说，从他的爷爷的爸爸就开始种植咖啡了，始于1891年。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibb8siay9NwyOXZThzfQWkO9ricCWBWWYUHU1v4IcYXbvmpibB4KyGpo9HA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           马德尔和他的弟弟费利佩小时候生活在家族的咖啡农场里，直到学龄，为了上学，不得不离开咖啡农场，搬到了哥伦比亚第二大城市—麦德林。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n<span>\n           离开农场的他们显然非常不适应，好在每周末都能回去。慢慢的，他们适应了城市的节奏。马德尔选择了法律专业；费利佩选择了医学专业。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibXV1ysxgmHa5SJXTb6f6uySWpfl01QeqqKeQibJPiaq1nsHtznq66buUQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           毕业之后，两兄弟放弃了律师与医生的职业选择，他们希望延续并且发展家族的咖啡产业，希望在靠近城市的地方构建适合生态发展的精品咖啡农场：一个非常自然、原生态的咖啡森林：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibibVvYMK1WpXwTyriaTAJ1px544rBwSN72z05sENAtzMdzTBK71Hjse2A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           上次去庄园的时候，马德尔差点就跟他老爸去跳瀑布，他们说之前他和费利佩还有老爸每次来都会去跳\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           于2013年，终于在哥伦比亚麦德林附近，一个叫吉拉多塔镇(Girardota)山顶找到了一个原本就有种植咖啡和甘蔗的农场。他们考察种植环境以后，买下了该庄园。因庄园内有天然瀑布，故命名为瀑布庄园。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibA88d1TbhfAsicIp2iaPvwmGibXqibEEQZlnmxKibblOcDzc2e228Ydwco2A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           这个庄园的种植海拔在1650-1850masl,目前庄园内已经种植了卡斯蒂尤、塔比、瑰夏、希爪、黄波旁、哥伦比亚F7等；也一直在培育新的品种和研发测试新的加工处理方式。发现好的品种和好的加工处理法，我们都会推荐给其他咖啡农。公司的团队，定期都会到庄园内做记录，做报告和工作安排；每个月都会整理出整体的种植生产报告。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibTgnCe0fqEWdBLTyeR1EASIU63UWayocnJ9Fuiccgo8OSQR6fERzq6iaQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于黄瑰夏品种\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           这个批次的黄瑰夏品种，源自于2013年，庄园将从巴拿马引种的瑰夏育种栽种后，有一些咖啡树结果是黄色的果子，于是庄园就把这些黄色果子才采收下来再去育种单独栽种在庄园的最高海拔地块，目前在农场种植的数量不是很多，所以每年能做的产品批次也非常非常的有限，我们这个批次仅有16kg；\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibbHNXH022Giba4rfRfc1KBlpxF12jwEh8xUk5qKrM6CqWicv8ibqXRmX9A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           这个批次的处理方式是鲜果浮选后，在遮荫下的晒床缓慢干燥；\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" sty